	(text "KVPWR - how this sheet works (POWER_SPEC 1.4, BOARD_MANUAL 6)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 186.69 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e01fdd20-a5b2-5cf7-91b4-79ff58050f7f")
	)
	(text "1. One supply and one ground for both boards: J1001 -> L1004 (both lines) -> VIN_J. J1001's sleeve is GND_IN; it reaches GND only through L1004."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 191.77 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1a14fb9d-8376-5149-8c94-a6dd1c05e4ad")
	)
	(text "2. VIN_J -> F1001 -> the adapter (POWER sheet). VIN_J -> Q1010 -> U1010 -> +12V_KV -> J1004 -> jumper -> KV260 J12."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e7e97288-8e9a-504b-84e6-eae0790837aa")
	)
	(text "3. U1010: OVP 14.4 V (KV260: SMAJ16A, its own cutoff 13.2 V), UVLO 8.0 V, current limit 3.0 A, auto-retry; -60 V reverse with Q1010/Q1011."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ef1f5b85-8167-5997-ab9e-7524567ba2f8")
	)
	(text "4. In a car the module needs a regulated 12 V supply upstream: the KV260 does not run above 13.2 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 204.47 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "112b1eed-c3a2-5ba4-b671-e91618294e21")
	)
